 "seed_choice": "In time order (load_order below; build.json written_at, the sweep's written_at): the seed search's build, seed 1 (build.json 15:10:05 UTC; CK - DQS -964 / -740 ps), did not calibrate on its first load (15:11 UTC, die 38.8 C before the load). The sweep of seeds 1-12 was then written (15:18:58 UTC) and seed 6 chosen from it as the first of seed_rank: among the seeds meeting 83.33 MHz, the smallest largest |CK - DQS| over the two lanes (177 ps; seed 5 next at 424 ps, although one of its lanes is at -24 ps). Seed 6 was built (build.json 15:22:44 UTC) and loaded three times (15:23-15:28 UTC, die 48.9-50.6 C), calibrating each time. Seed 1 was loaded a second time after those, as a control at the seed-6 temperature (15:31:50 UTC, die 51.0 C before the load, 10 s capture): it did not calibrate either. x16 builds that calibrated in #61 had CK - DQS -290/-310, -680/-370 and +740/+1090 ps. Ranking by this skew is a rule taken from #61's correlation, not a timing analysis.",
